# macOS 13.5 (22G74) OS volume, desktop tier (2026-11-04): nearly the whole system volume, so the desktop is not
# brought up one missing file at a time as 26.5 was. Left out by build-macos-root.sh (MAXFILE): every file over
# 16 MiB (96 in /System/Library, ~3.3 GB: ML models, voices, media assets; listed in $W/skipped-desktop.txt to fetch
# by name if one is needed). /System/Library/Extensions (kexts) is left out: our kernel loads none. Code of frameworks
# lives in the shared cache (from the SystemOS cryptex), so this is executables, plists and resources. --thin.
